  "question": {
    "text": "A hyperbola has foci <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4,2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and it passes through <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;The eccentricity of the hyperbola is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and</p><p>the eccentricity of the hyperbola is <math><mi>e</mi></math>, then</p><p><math><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi></math> and <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></math> (where,&nbsp;<math><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></math> is the length of the transverse axis)<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math></p>"
  }
